msgctxt "80\t183"
msgid "Kashiwagi-san told me something before he died."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "193\t394"
msgid ""
"He said someone's trying to push\\nthe resort deal through. Someone in the "
"Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "399\t459"
msgid "Then he was right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472\t592"
msgid ""
"And the only four Tojo boys who could\\npull it off... are right in front of"
" you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "798\t874"
msgid "That wasn't the only thing Kashiwagi-san said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "875\t1066"
msgid "He told me the traitor is\\nworking with the man who shot Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1079\t1169"
msgid "You know who pulled the trigger!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1405\t1701"
msgid ""
"And it wasn't just Daigo. The man who owns the land\\nthey want to build the"
" resort on, Nakahara. They shot him, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1743\t1815"
msgid "Is this some kinda sick joke?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1816\t1952"
msgid "Kazama-san's gone! How is this possible!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1953\t2027"
msgid "I'm not sure it's really him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2037\t2200"
msgid "But we have this man, who put bullets\\nin both Daigo and Nakahara."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2202\t2312"
msgid "The foreigners in black suits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2313\t2406"
msgid "And that helicopter attack."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2453\t2537"
msgid "Who are we up against here...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2538\t2741"
msgid ""
"Doesn't matter. All we can do now is\\nweed out the traitor in the Tojo "
"Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2742\t2784"
msgid "Agreed."
msgstr "Concordo."

msgctxt "2813\t2925"
msgid "I'll try digging up some dirt\\non this guy in the sketch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2947\t3107"
msgid "You track down the one who probably\\noffed Kashiwagi... Kanda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3161\t3208"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "Ok."
